{"at":"2026-03-01T22:28:36.553Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":571,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/faq-mls/","title":"FAQ (MLS & CRM)","description":null,"body":"<div><h1 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">PropertyList.es MLS &amp; CRM: Frequently Asked Questions</h1><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Does Propertylist.es require a credit card to join?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">No, a form of payment is NOT required to join. Only if you want to buy credits.</span><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><br></span><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Is PropertyList.es free to use?</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Yes, PropertyList.es is FREE to use with paid features within the system that are optional.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">What are the benefits of using PropertyList.es?</h2><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - For Freelancers:</strong><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">PropertyList.es allows freelancers to share their listings at no cost. This cost-efficient approach is especially helpful for those starting out in the industry.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - For Agencies:&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Agencies can freely share their properties with a wide audience. Additionally, they can manage staff accounts, listings, events, and documents—all in one place.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - For Developers:&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Listing new developments for free on PropertyList.es helps developers reach thousands of agents and buyers. It also facilitates connections with property services that may prove valuable.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - For Property Services:&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">We welcome all services related to property, connect with estate agents, developers, and property seekers, expanding your network and business opportunities.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - For Buyers/Renters:</strong><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Extensive Property Listings:</strong><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;PropertyList.es aggregates a wide range of properties, making it easier for buyers and renters to find their ideal home or investment.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Agent Expertise:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Buyers and renters can benefit from the expertise of real estate agents associated with the platform. Agents can guide them through the process, answer questions, and provide insights.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Advanced Search Filters:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Users can filter properties based on specific criteria (such as location, price range, amenities, etc.), saving time and effort.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">What is an MLS &amp; CRM?</h2><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Multiple Listing Service (MLS)</strong><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">This is a platform specifically designed for real estate agents to share information and collaborate on listings. PropertyList.es facilitates this agent-to-agent communication, allowing agents to expose their listings to a wider pool of potential buyers and renters represented by other agents on the platform totally FREE!</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></strong><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Customer Relationship Management (CRM)</strong><br>This is a software that helps agents manage their interactions with clients. PropertyList.es’ CRM features help agents track leads, manage communications, and stay organised throughout the sales or rental process.<br></p><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">What is PropertyList.es?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">PropertyList.es is a full-service solution for real estate agents in Spain. It functions as both a Multiple Listing Service (MLS), a Customer Relationship Management (CRM), Public faceing Property Portal and Lead Generation platform.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">How can I access property market data on PropertyList.es?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Coming Soon – PropertyList.es provides access to valuable market data, including trends, comparative analysis tools, and insights into buyer preferences.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Can I link/add properties to a contact’s profile?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Yes, PropertyList.es allows you to link properties to contacts. Learn how to do this here.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">How do I list a property on PropertyList.es?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">You’ll need to be a registered agent with a PropertyList.es account. The specific listing process can be found here.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">How can I assign a contact to a specific agent?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">PropertyList.es allows you to assign contacts to agents for streamlined communication and task management. Learn how to assign your contact a staff member here.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Can I add professional contacts to a client’s profile?</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Yes, PropertyList.es allows you to link professional contacts (lawyers, architects, etc.) to your client’s profile. You can specify the type of professional relationship for better organization. Learn more here.</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">How do I sign up for PropertyList.es?</h2><a href=\"https://developers.propertylist.es/new-agent-signup/new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">Sign up for FREE here</a><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\">. (NO credit card information required)</span><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"></div>","seo_title":"FAQ (MLS & CRM) • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}